
---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Organic Intelligence-informed coaching for traders navigating pressure, uncertainty and high-performance decision-making."
    />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f7f6f2" />
    <title>Trading Mind — Coaching for Traders</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
    <link
      rel="preconnect"
      href="https://fonts.gstatic.com"
      crossorigin
    />
    <link
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:wght@400;450;500;550;600;650;700&display=swap"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="first-screen">
      <header class="site-header">
        <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Trading Mind home">
          trading<span>mind</span>
        </a>

        <nav class="nav-links" aria-label="Main navigation">
          <a href="/">Coaching</a>
          <a href="/course">Free course</a>
          <a class="nav-cta" href="#contact">Get in touch</a>
        </nav>
      </header>

      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1>
            Develop your <em>nervous system capacity</em>
          </h1>

          <p class="hero-description">
            One-to-one coaching for traders who want to improve performance
            and manage the stress of trading.
          </p>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a class="button button-dark" href="#contact">
              Explore coaching
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <main>
      <section class="editorial-intro" id="approach">
        <div class="editorial-intro__inner">
          <div class="intro-grid">
            <div class="intro-card">
              <h2>The challenge</h2>

              <p>
                Uncertainty, risk and missed opportunities can place sustained demands on your ability to think clearly. 
Most people focus on strategy, but strategy is only as good as your ability to execute it. 
If you find yourself overtrading, becoming burnt out, overwhelmed by decisions or caught in cycles of addiction, nervous system capacity is the constraint.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="intro-card">
              <h2>A different approach</h2>

              <p>
               Performance isn't just about what you know. It's about how you respond under pressure. 
Rather than focusing on controlling emotions or correcting unwanted behaviour through willpower or discipline, we work with the underlying nervous system patterns that shape how you respond to the stress of trading.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="intro-card">
              <h2>How it works</h2>

              <p>
                   By supporting your natural ability to adapt and self-organise, we develop your capacity to remain calm under pressure, make better decisions, and ultimately build a more enjoyable relationship with trading and life in general.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="contact-section" id="contact">
        <h2>Interested in working together?</h2>

        <a
          class="button button-light"
          href="https://x.com/youngtilopa"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          Get in touch
        </a>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer class="site-footer">
      <a class="brand footer-brand" href="/">
        trading<span>mind</span>
      </a>

      <p class="copyright">© {year} Trading Mind</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>

<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light;
    --paper: #f7f6f2;
    --ink: #262822;
    --muted: #77796f;
    --olive: #858c70;
    --line: #deded5;
    --soft: #eeeee7;
  }

  :global(*) {
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }

  :global(html) {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
    scroll-padding-top: 100px;
  }

  :global(body) {
    margin: 0;
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    font-family: "DM Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
  }

  :global(a),
  :global(a:visited) {
    color: inherit;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  :global(a:focus-visible) {
    outline: 2px solid var(--olive);
    outline-offset: 5px;
  }

  h1,
  h2,
  p {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  /* First screen */

  .first-screen {
    min-height: 100vh;
    min-height: 100svh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  /* Header */

  .site-header {
    min-height: 86px;
    padding: 0 7.2%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 28px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .brand {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    white-space: nowrap;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .brand > span {
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .nav-links {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: flex-end;
    gap: clamp(17px, 2.6vw, 38px);
  }

  .nav-links a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    color: #55574f;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    white-space: nowrap;
    transition: color 160ms ease, background 160ms ease;
  }

  .nav-links a:hover {
    color: var(--olive);
  }

  .nav-links .nav-cta {
    padding: 10px 15px;
    border: 1px solid #c9cabe;
    border-radius: 2px;
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .nav-links .nav-cta:hover {
    background: var(--ink);
    border-color: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
  }

  /* Hero */

  .hero {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
    padding: 60px 7.2%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .hero-copy {
    max-width: 790px;
  }

  h1 {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    font-size: clamp(40px, 5.2vw, 70px);
    font-weight: 450;
    letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    line-height: 1.08;
  }

  h1 em {
    color: var(--olive);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .hero-description {
    max-width: 500px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .hero-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
  }

  /* Buttons */

  .button {
    min-height: 44px;
    padding: 0 18px;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: background 160ms ease, color 160ms ease;
  }

  .button-dark,
  .button-dark:visited {
    background: var(--ink);
    color: #fff !important;
  }

  .button-dark:hover {
    background: #45483d;
  }

  .button-light,
  .button-light:visited {
    border: 1px solid #c9cabe;
    color: var(--ink) !important;
  }

  .button-light:hover {
    background: var(--soft);
  }

  /* Three-column introduction */

  .editorial-intro {
    background: var(--paper);
    padding: 72px 0 80px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .editorial-intro__inner {
    width: min(85.6%, 1120px);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .intro-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 24px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .intro-card {
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 24px 22px;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid #e3e2da;
    border-radius: 6px;
  }

  .intro-card h2 {
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 550;
    line-height: 1.4;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .intro-card p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #62635c;
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  /* Contact section */

  .contact-section {
    padding: 88px 7.2% 96px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-section h2 {
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    font-size: clamp(28px, 2.5vw, 32px);
    font-weight: 450;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  /* Footer */

  .site-footer {
    min-height: 83px;
    padding: 22px 7.2%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 18px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .footer-brand {
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .site-footer p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 11px;
  }

  /* Large screens */

  @media (min-width: 1500px) {
    .site-header,
    .hero,
    .contact-section,
    .site-footer {
      padding-left: max(7.2%, calc((100vw - 1240px) / 2));
      padding-right: max(7.2%, calc((100vw - 1240px) / 2));
    }
  }

  /* Mobile */

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .site-header {
      min-height: auto;
      padding: 23px 6%;
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 21px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: flex-start;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 12px 21px;
    }

    .hero {
      padding: 45px 6%;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(40px, 9vw, 52px);
      letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    }

    .editorial-intro {
      padding: 48px 0 56px;
    }

    .editorial-intro__inner {
      width: 88%;
    }

    .intro-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .intro-card {
      padding: 24px 22px;
    }

    .intro-card h2 {
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .intro-card p {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .contact-section {
      padding: 70px 6%;
    }

    .contact-section h2 {
      font-size: 28px;
    }

    .site-footer {
      padding: 24px 6%;
    }
  }

  /* Short screens */

  @media (max-height: 750px) {
    .hero {
      padding-top: 35px;
      padding-bottom: 35px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(40px, 5.2vw, 62px);
    }
  }

  /* Reduced motion */

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    :global(html) {
      scroll-behavior: auto;
    }

    :global(*),
    :global(*::before),
    :global(*::after) {
      transition: none !important;
    }
  }
</style>
